Comment: 0,0:22:34.64,0:22:37.89,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5}誰かの想いも
Comment: 0,0:22:37.89,0:22:41.27,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5}連れて行ける　待っていて
Comment: 0,0:22:41.27,0:22:46.60,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5}この声を　想いを　僕を
